{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "cc7d1ce62181420e24939f462e305d8505ebd8e3259bcbfdb4cfbd6d63c7ebb1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nちょうどいいところに……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你来得正好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9ce7980f740004b3674449da4bff053fac36c8b16193d6a27395dbd64b349ba3", "ja": "おっと、なんでしょうか。\n重い荷物が届いたとか？", "zh": "哎呀，怎么了？\n是有很重的包裹送到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5deafa72d4e50c82c000451f862004739cb16761151e1a97ca7b57ab18271144", "ja": "あ、今はそういうのじゃなくて。\nえへへ、いつも助かってます♪", "zh": "啊，现在不是那种事。\n嘿嘿，一直都承蒙您帮忙啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "3554abeeb9e30c8abac1ddeed44d7ed12a21e25c9a22ee5a1ec5daaf77eb3d5c", "ja": "それよりちょっと相談したいことがあって……、\nあ、全然大したことじゃないんですけど！", "zh": "比起那个，我有件事想和您商量一下……  \n啊，也不是什么大不了的事啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "87ca3da4a4f7f87dff6e10e56dbc9d232e909f604dc6f5fa527595fb8f07f50a", "ja": "実はさっき、黒井社長からお電話があって。", "zh": "其实刚才，黑井社长打电话过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5fbc4d5917bde4ad0d07668afe573bb3555b163408a1ae0980b2281aa4c4119a", "ja": "黒井社長から？　珍しいですね。", "zh": "黑井社长打来的？真少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "40a825778f93112873c649c35b80a491d5cb8ee5bfaeb23c3bae7d7815e7cd71", "ja": "ですよね！　連絡いただくことが珍しいのに、\nしかもメールとかじゃなくて電話でなんて！", "zh": "就是啊！难得收到他的联系，居然还不是邮件，而是直接打电话过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "34e0b0c9b733b69c92d2c50ed4a52b45f9ce01ae981928cdf70ebf24107d703d", "ja": "それで、ご用件を伺おうとしたら、\n「いや、やっぱりなんでもない。フンッ！」って。", "zh": "然后我正想问您有什么事，您却说：“不，还是没什么事。哼！”就挂断了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dc243258be51fab7d1091342e38934f5c852a00f29e0f757afea586b72e32aef", "ja": "切れちゃったんですか？", "zh": "是挂断了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "bc32f07a03c0abe84e369b5ec633aca8dc1876203783b3b9d0245a1122325969", "ja": "そうなんです！　絶対なんでもなくないですよね？\nトラブルとかじゃないといいんですけど……。", "zh": "就是这样！肯定不可能什么事都没有吧？\n希望不是什么麻烦才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "43f4d6a62c1df1e0fa7532d74e47449bbb717e7658249b7ee778b1de5fa0f2e3", "ja": "うーん……最近は961プロとの交流もあるし、\n連絡があること自体はおかしくないんですが……。", "zh": "嗯……最近也和961制作人有交流，收到联系本身倒也不奇怪，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c28171798d79759abc3bdb6f5c15ee5be928df054ab12c0866c6cbd0e662433b", "ja": "まあ、大丈夫だと思いますよ。\n黒井社長とは、考え方は違いますが……。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得应该没问题。\n虽然和黑井社长的想法不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ed79d627085513f73d50a1134c4628eeb2717abde2be61c58cd0f3696671b746", "ja": "アイドルプロデュースにかける情熱は、\nきっと何も違わない人だと思います。", "zh": "我觉得，他对偶像制作倾注的热情，一定和我们没有什么不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "4e5eec426dcf3e15184f07cb0bdbaa709edf307355ed7eecb7c844ef1f968296", "ja": "あ、そうですよね！　響ちゃん達もお世話になったし、\n玲音さんや詩花ちゃんの事務所の社長さんですもんね！", "zh": "啊，对哦！响她们也受过他的照顾，而且他还是玲音小姐和诗花的事务所社长嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "afc122c129654090a8b971fc6dc70a0df3cbefe62cf911a869189384e7e35dd6", "ja": "あ、でも黒井社長の前に、うちの社長さんからも\n{$P$}さんに電話があったんでした！", "zh": "啊，不过在黑井社长之前，我们社长也给{$P$}先生打过电话来着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "31679d5160f8ddbde678394eacb98641ba7dae0a2483d0671c904c829d0bc3c5", "ja": "これって……もしかして、\n黒井社長からの電話と関係あるんでしょうか？", "zh": "这个……难道和黑井社长打来的电话有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1bc130a6900f8b5b8b0fd175a73d8aa6ec6c14e7669530c4f1ceb40133e5d206", "ja": "なるほど。それは何かありそうな……。\n早速事務所に行って話を聞いてきます！", "zh": "原来如此。看来确实有什么内情……\n我这就去事务所问问情况！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "813b8acd740078ce43cc31113f15cce829cf1edd980516f953a9d9366a25a3a8", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます♪\nよろしくお願いしますね～！", "zh": "哇，谢谢您♪\n那就拜托您啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1018_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1019_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "60b735c09d54263022e20d7add4953c5b83eb45e5a855ca61e148aad754c3562", "ja": "失礼します……あれ？", "zh": "打扰了……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "2b767a9c95db538726e2e54720e152638727b33eff7e273c183526ee223e9ebc", "ja": "おお、君か！\nよく来てくれたね、待っていたよ。", "zh": "哦，是你啊！\n你来得正好，我一直在等你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2784978ab9a101857001daf766dc609635f95ea8cb63a1e781f7a9a35e6508b7", "ja": "お待たせしました。あの、音無さんはどちらに？\nてっきりこちらにいると思ったんですが。", "zh": "让您久等了。那个，音无小姐去哪儿了？\n我还以为她会在这里来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "cf193c3bfe0274932f6aa27fa64e9912884ad70afa1de90f9c3ba58538ce8969", "ja": "ああ、音無君には、ちょっと挨拶に行って\nもらっているのだよ。961プロまでね。", "zh": "啊，我让音无君去打个招呼了。\n还要去961位制作人那里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "cd5f6bda3ab56a8dbe0e7eac25ac2e36f6a20960091cb8c7c8ec713ae09e54b2", "ja": "961プロ。ということは、やはり今日のお話は……\n961プロとの新企画、ですか？", "zh": "961事务所。这么说来，今天的事果然是……\n关于和961事务所的新企划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "c0d62a3d5f2637dfccc7b71208b6ad9a663b7d985a1aee5d01230515137364b7", "ja": "ふふふ、察しがいいじゃないか。さすがは君だ。", "zh": "呵呵呵，真是敏锐啊。不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "72ea0d82a1ac8fed5ea69bd99500ac828ac5c0b3e5c3a1f9f1331131bd96b24e", "ja": "改めて、先日の961プロ主催の合同フェスでの\nパフォーマンスは、じつに見事だった！", "zh": "再次称赞一句，前几天在961事务所主办的联合音乐节上的\n演出，真是太精彩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "5fd12ff83a94897a45f0ef394446ffd9fa8d8b37a762509d055a4ec68674099b", "ja": "黒井の企画ということで不安もあったと思うが、\nアイドル諸君にも君にも、いい経験になったようだね。", "zh": "虽然对这是黑井策划的项目感到不安，但看来无论是各位偶像还是你，都从中获得了很好的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6ff51021cc2112912279d9d08c4f438c3a50bff54962fff03dfb8c95cb42b99d", "ja": "はい。いろいろと成長させてもらえたと思います。", "zh": "是的。我觉得自己也在各方面都有所成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "b6dd5ae17d2923375439d9f36e2b66c664a76169cfb47d5ae3f21a59fe711dea", "ja": "うむ。あの時は黒井に呼んでもらう立場だっただろう？\nそこで、今回はこちらが企画しようと思っている。", "zh": "嗯。那时候我们是被黑井邀请的立场对吧？\n所以，这次我想由我们这边来策划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "7f852397ab35cabb7452b79105909caf416f12efb5833c6ede7dec6e8b38ce03", "ja": "つまり、我が765プロ主催の合同フェスを開催し、\n961プロからもアイドルを呼ぼう、というわけだ！", "zh": "也就是说，要举办由我们765事务所主办的联合庆典，还要邀请961事务所的偶像来参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "fcc88c6c7ad64cd66711aa97b90306d2908fb8af0a9c16f4ae703f737b3cc52e", "ja": "黒井とはもう話をつけてある。まぁ最初はアレコレと\n渋っていたが、最後には快くOKをもらえたよ！", "zh": "和黑井已经谈妥了。虽然一开始还在这啊那啊地推三阻四，但最后还是爽快答应了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "c9ae48c5f9c7917f707bf0b459a1f0c08f90e1c15de18580c1ad1b01c56417cb", "ja": "で、961プロからは詩花君を招待することになった。\nどうも自薦らしいがね。", "zh": "于是，决定邀请961制作人的诗花。听说好像是她自荐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "eb030d89c2df7639bf63c1cd0034f6a0587174e6b2d252270a91fb72ba0e52a1", "ja": "なるほど。なんとなく経緯が目に浮かぶような……。\nいえ、わかりました。", "zh": "原来如此。总觉得事情的经过已经浮现在眼前了……\n不，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "17a32f1270c01b80528659d012a76e5c16556bba9555550c3ea9bb4bc29feff2", "ja": "詩花はよく劇場に来てくれますし、アイドル達とも\nすっかり仲良くなっています。問題もないかと！", "zh": "诗花经常来剧场，也已经和偶像们打成一片了。我想应该没什么问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "5dcb02cad8003b5442197b1fb49f49ea88d172f6719a051a8f9ccec64fb7cf0c", "ja": "そのようだね。それに今回同じステージに立つことで、\nアイドル諸君にも、新しい刺激になることだろう。", "zh": "看来是这样。而且，这次和各位站在同一个舞台上，对偶像们来说也会成为一种新的刺激吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "e80e6aafb35cbbc29d281efc1c8233bc965a5b88b2bdcb6f6b957b1e18672529", "ja": "というわけで……。例によってだが、\n今回のイベントも君に一任したいと思っている！", "zh": "所以……还是和往常一样，这次的活动也想全权交给你负责！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "865caa241c54464f98a282e7c0543eda58a1778c1213c698b95b5526540c73aa", "ja": "はい！　961プロとは一味違う、\n765プロならではのステージにしたいと思います！", "zh": "好的！我想打造一场与961事务所截然不同、尽显765事务所特色的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1039_president", "source_sha256": "d750c2c3a3984ba0da8454a94060fdf9282955b401c66a65b48fffbfaaea889a", "ja": "うむ！　期待しているよ～！", "zh": "嗯！我很期待哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1040_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1041_p", "source_sha256": "c56ad178cee16c9559e4d02bdd90ed5175884d6779e17fc95a638fe76b58293b", "ja": "今回の765プロと961プロの合同ステージには、\nこのメンバーで出てもらうことになった。よろしく！", "zh": "本次765事务所和961事务所的联合舞台，决定让这些成员登场。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
