{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1049_p", "source_sha256": "8a0330967aace47407e2019b53402ced403bbdd47867efef83f2e5fb3c49f1a2", "ja": "ユニットリーダーは琴葉、サブリーダーは\n真にお願いしたい。頼めるかな？", "zh": "希望由琴叶担任队长，真担任副队长。可以拜托你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1050_017kth", "source_sha256": "7e6abca4450cd5c23e29fcfe2baf3e96607b862d5e65397eaaff44881645524a", "ja": "あ……、はいっ。\n責任重大ですけど、精一杯、頑張ります！", "zh": "啊……好的！\n责任重大，不过我会竭尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "6b23e7b8d767d208e2e371843d6ca7c6828ceb35d2ab4daf980adefdc7121430", "ja": "へへっ、わかりました。\nサポートは任せてください！", "zh": "嘿嘿，明白了。支持工作就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1052_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ba20c516490120c45c270f4f3278a356799b3376bb5315841fbdbdd5590ba988", "ja": "改めて……みなさん、グリュース・ゴット♪\nお招きいただけて、本当にうれしいです！", "zh": "再次向大家问好……格吕斯·戈特♪  \n能受到邀请，我真的非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1053_001har", "source_sha256": "b65578005b7039af41a1c577279650d2eb8d1d0e30796ba289cb8067ab7f9c4b", "ja": "こちらこそ！　詩花ちゃんと一緒に歌えるなんて、\nうれしいなぁ～。ね、未来ちゃん！", "zh": "我才要说谢谢！居然能和诗花一起唱歌，\n真是开心呀～对吧，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "27817972673ef799d2f5675c6ceffbd31326207baac8692fe9379702fa41957c", "ja": "はいっ！　詩花さんと春香さん、それに真さん響さん、\n伊織ちゃんと琴葉ちゃんも！　賑やかでうれしいです♪", "zh": "好的！能和诗花、春香、真、响，还有伊织和琴叶一起唱歌，热热闹闹的，真开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1055_007ior", "source_sha256": "0a86f05ab98c25d2c64716275e3b65ce3c75e7e4b4f2d86d2f4ca4eb417b5add", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんの魅力を、詩花のファンに見せつけて\nあげるチャンスね。にひひっ、楽しみだわ♪", "zh": "这是让诗花的粉丝见识一下我伊织魅力的好机会呢。嘻嘻，真期待啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1056_013hib", "source_sha256": "6b66387d15528d4f8d2aac41cdfddee184e2df384a70b5e2cf6b75083dfb2c9f", "ja": "で、自分達はどんな曲を歌うの？\n961プロっぽい、バチバチにカッコイイやつ？", "zh": "那我们要唱什么样的歌？  \n961专业范儿十足、帅到爆的那种？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1057_p", "source_sha256": "ff8c938312ed3271e7c053d6b88743c7abe2f541e81c2413c6daf555cd5a66d3", "ja": "どうかな。ある意味では、より攻めた曲とも\nいえると思う。コンセプトは、ズバリ……。", "zh": "怎么说呢。某种意义上，也可以说是更加激进的歌曲。概念嘛，直截了当地说就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_intro_1058_p", "source_sha256": "c6b8ccb0233e8c45ddd0bd5ee3e2f1d8ad05d76f879b9c66b8e2e22901a786ff", "ja": "『KAWAII』だ！", "zh": "就是『KAWAII』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
